<div class="smoke-radio-editor"><header><h2>Set the presets.</h2><p>Use direct HTTPS MP3 or AAC streams. The station website provides a fallback when playback is unavailable. Players press Listen on their own device. Studio contacts power <b>Message the studio</b>: a studio chat opens the station's own chat inside Foundry (use the address their site embeds, such as a Chatroll or Minnit link); WhatsApp, text and email open the player's own app with their message filled in.</p></header><div class="smoke-radio-editor-rows">{{#each stations}}<fieldset data-radio-row><legend>Preset {{number}}</legend><input type="hidden" data-field="id" value="{{id}}"><div class="smoke-field-grid"><label>Station name<input data-field="name" value="{{name}}" maxlength="64" required></label><label>Music / genres<input data-field="genre" value="{{genre}}" maxlength="100"></label></div><label>Live stream URL<input type="url" data-field="stream" value="{{stream}}" placeholder="https://…/live.mp3" required></label><label>Station website<input type="url" data-field="website" value="{{website}}" required></label><label>radio.net page (optional)<input type="url" data-field="directory" value="{{directory}}"></label><details class="smoke-radio-contacts" {{#if hasContact}}open{{/if}}><summary>Studio contacts · Message the studio (all optional)</summary><label>Studio chat shown inside Foundry (HTTPS embed link)<input type="url" data-field="chatUrl" value="{{chatUrl}}" placeholder="https://chatroll.com/embed/chat/…"></label><div class="smoke-field-grid"><label>WhatsApp number<input type="tel" data-field="whatsapp" value="{{whatsapp}}" placeholder="+44 7700 900123"></label><label>Text (SMS) number<input type="tel" data-field="sms" value="{{sms}}" placeholder="+44 7700 900123"></label><label>Studio phone<input type="tel" data-field="phone" value="{{phone}}" placeholder="+44 20 7946 0000"></label><label>Studio email<input type="email" data-field="email" value="{{email}}" placeholder="studio@example.com"></label></div><label>Message page or chat (HTTPS)<input type="url" data-field="messageUrl" value="{{messageUrl}}" placeholder="https://…/contact"></label></details><button type="button" data-radio-editor="remove" data-index="{{@index}}">Remove preset</button></fieldset>{{/each}}</div><footer><button type="button" data-radio-editor="add">Add station</button><button type="button" data-radio-editor="reset">Restore originals</button><button type="button" class="primary" data-radio-editor="save">Save presets</button></footer></div>
